# 懵然不知
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:完全唔知道、一啲都唔察覺嘅意思。形容對某件事完全冇留意，或者冇意識到發生咗咩事。
eng:completely unaware; to have no idea about something
<eg>
yue:佢懵然不知自己俾人偷咗銀包。 (keoi5 mung2 jin4 bat1 zi1 zi6 gei2 bei2 jan4 tau1 zo2 ngan4 baau1.)
eng:He was completely unaware that his wallet had been stolen.
<eg>
yue:我問佢尋晚發生咩事，佢竟然懵然不知。 (ngo5 man6 keoi5 cam4 maan5 faat3 sang1 me1 si6, keoi5 ging2 jin4 mung2 jin4 bat1 zi1.)
eng:I asked him what happened last night, and he was totally clueless. [end of text]


